[31m-[m
[31m-> Everything not presently addressable.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-This produced:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-Taiji = reachable relevance[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Mu = unreachable possibility[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Not because it cannot ever become reachable.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Only because no path presently exists.[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-# Part XIII[m
[31m-# The Taiji Revision[m
[31m-[m
[31m-At this point a major revision occurred.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Traditional interpretations often treat:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-Yin ↔ Yang[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-[m
[31m-as balanced opposites.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-However a different interpretation emerged.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Yin:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-> Diffusion[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Yang:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-> Convergence[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Yang is therefore not opposite Yin.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Yang is a local organization of Yin.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Like:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- whirlpool in water[m
[31m-- star in nebula[m
[31m-- knot in rope[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Therefore:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```[m
[31m-Yang ⊂ Yin[m
