[31m-This was a crucial shift.[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-# Part XIV[m
[31m-# Taiji as Addressed Yin[m
[31m-[m
[31m-The next realization followed naturally.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-If Yin is diffuse possibility,[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Then:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-> Taiji is addressed Yin.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Not a static structure.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Not a repository.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Not a fixed set.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Instead:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-> A local organization of possibility.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-The analogy proposed:[m
