[31m-> Taiji is a revolving sushi bar of Mu.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Reality presents opportunities for relevance.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-The menu constantly changes.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-The process remains.[m
[31m-[m
[31m----[m
[31m-[m
[31m-# Part XV[m
[31m-# Contribution Rather Than Extraction[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Another inversion emerged.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Most models treat knowledge as extraction.[m
